## 🎯 Project Overview

This project demonstrates my ability to build and operate a Security Operations Center (SOC) monitoring environment using the **ELK Stack** (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana). I designed a complete threat detection pipeline that:

- **Collects** Windows Security logs and Sysmon telemetry
- **Transports** logs securely to a centralized SIEM
- **Visualizes** security events in real-time dashboards
- **Detects** brute force attacks and suspicious activity
- **Maps** detections to the MITRE ATT&CK framework

This lab simulates a real-world SOC environment where analysts monitor endpoints for malicious activity.

